========================================
   .ENV TEMPLATE — COPY KE FILE .env
========================================
Isi dengan nilai asli, lalu rename jadi .env
(klik kanan -> rename, hapus ".example" jadi ".env")


----------------------------------------
TELEGRAM (wajib)
----------------------------------------
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=paste_token_dari_botfather_disini


----------------------------------------
METAAPI.CLOUD (wajib — sumber data XAU/USD)
----------------------------------------
# Daftar di https://app.metaapi.cloud (free tier: 100k CU/bulan)
# 1. Sign up & verify email
# 2. Tambah MetaTrader 5 account (paper trading OK)
# 3. Deploy account (tunggu status DEPLOYED)
# 4. Copy token dari Profile -> API tokens
# 5. Copy account ID dari daftar account
METAAPI_TOKEN=paste_metaapi_token_disini
METAAPI_ACCOUNT_ID=paste_account_id_disini
